Props Drilling
------------------
Sharing data from Parent to Child comp using props
This Process is called props Drilling

 Props Drilling
 1. Things will become more complex as more components are nested.
 2. If any component fails to recieve the data then destination component will never recieve the data.
 3. If intermediate component does not require data, then we should make data available to them.

 
 Context API
 ----------------
 Context Concept is suitable for sharing the data from Parent Comp to Child at any level.
 
 Context api is a simple technique to share data from parent comp to child comp.


Props and contextAPI are not recommended when data is passing through child to parent or in-between siblings.
it is only used to share data parent to child 


if we want to share the data from child to parent or in siblings
we impliments Redux


