useEffect()
    It is hook in react
    It is a special function in react.

    What is the Purpose of useEffect()
    It is used to perform sideEffects in the React Functional Component.
    or
    It is used to connect with external system in the React Functional Component.



What is Pure Function in JS?
A pure function is a function that always return same result or output
if the same input or argument passed to the function.

A pure function does not contains any sideEffect

What are sideEffects






- All react functional component are Pure functions.

Functional Component Does not contains SideEffect.

-sideEffect can be added in the event handlers.
-useEffect() hook.

What are pure functions
what is sideEffect
Where to perform sideEffect in React Functional Component
