    period from birth to death

    Child 0-16
    Young 16-40
    Old Phase 40+

    Lifecycle of Component

    Once Component loads in the DOM

    Component removed from the DOM

    The process if loading the component in the DOM is called Mounting

    The Process of removing component from the DOM is called Unmounting

    Mount Phase

    Update Phase

    Unmount Phase


